[E0303] Error: cannot apply `+` to `bool`
    ╭─[ err/23_operators/main.wip:12:18 ]
    │
 12 │     val a = true + false
    │             ──┬─ ┬ ──┬──
    │               ╰─────────── `bool`
    │                  │   │
    │                  ╰──────── arithmetic and ordering need numbers
    │                      │
    │                      ╰──── `bool`
────╯
[E0303] Error: cannot apply `*` to `f64` and `i64`
    ╭─[ err/23_operators/main.wip:13:17 ]
