 13 │     val b = 1.5 * 2
    │             ─┬─ ┬ ┬
    │              ╰─────── `f64`
    │                 │ │
    │                 ╰──── operands of different types
    │                   │
    │                   ╰── `i64`
    │
    │ Help: use a float literal
    │
    │ Note: Wip has no implicit numeric conversions
────╯
[E0303] Error: cannot negate a value of type `bool`
    ╭─[ err/23_operators/main.wip:14:13 ]
    │
 14 │     val c = -true
    │             ──┬──
    │               ╰──── `-` needs a number
