[E0303] Error: cannot apply `==` to `Point`
    ╭─[ err/23_operators/main.wip:18:18 ]
    │
 18 │     val same = p == q
    │                ┬ ─┬ ┬
    │                ╰─────── `Point`
    │                   │ │
    │                   ╰──── `==` and `!=` compare numbers or `bool`
    │                     │
    │                     ╰── `Point`
    │
    │ Help: write `@derive(Eq)` on `Point`, and the compiler writes the comparison field by field
    │
    │ Note: a type whose equality is not its fields writes `extend …: Eq` itself instead
────╯
